# Linux System Administrator Interview Preparation — L2 & L3

Based on your background in Linux system administration, hosting environments, cPanel/WHM, Plesk, AWS, networking, Apache/Nginx, MySQL, and DevOps, you should prepare for scenario-based L2 and L3 Linux administrator interviews, not just basic Linux commands.

L2 interviews generally focus on troubleshooting, administration, performance, and recovery. L3 interviews go deeper into root-cause analysis, architecture, advanced debugging, automation, and production incidents.

Here is your topic-wise preparation roadmap, designed for Linux Administrator, Senior Linux Administrator, System Engineer, and Linux/Cloud Operations roles.

