Commands and SQL: `mysql`, `SHOW PROCESSLIST`, `SHOW ENGINE INNODB STATUS`, `SHOW REPLICA STATUS`, `EXPLAIN`, `mysqldump`, `mysqlbinlog`, `iostat`.

